    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "As a recently freed slave in Absalom, you belong to a new, closeknit social class at the heart of the city's most important trades.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Constitution or Intelligence, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Society skill and the Absalom Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Streetwise skill feat."
